Content: There are exciting new updates on the horizon for <em>LifeSim</em> desktop! This update will add session management tools utilizing persistent application storage.;
Card:
<h4 class="subtitle">Overview</h4>
<ul class="list">
    <li>Quickly save or load metrics, cells, settings, and themes!</li>
    <li>A simple name-based storage system with automatic file overwriting.</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="subtitle">Expected</h4>
<ul class="list">
    <li>A visual-based menu for viewing, modifying, or loading saves.</li>
    <li>Web support for importing and exporting save files manually.</li>
</ul>;
